flowchart TD
    A[Cancel request] --> B{Reservation exists and actor authorized?}
    B -- No --> X1[Reject]
    B -- Yes --> C{Already CANCELLED?}
    C -- Yes --> I1[Return CANCELLED]
    C -- No --> D{Current state?}
    D -- Other --> X2[Reject]
    D -- CONFIRMED --> E{currentTime < startTime?}
    E -- No --> X3[Reject]
    E -- Yes --> F1[Set CANCELLED]
    D -- PENDING_APPROVAL --> P{currentTime < startTime?}
    P -- Yes --> F2[Set CANCELLED]
    P -- No --> H[Set EXPIRED]
    F1 --> I2[Return CANCELLED]
    F2 --> I3[Return CANCELLED]
    H --> J[Return EXPIRED]
